Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:17:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add ssh-mldsa44-ed25519 host key (OpenSSH 10.6)

OpenSSH 10.6 enables the hybrid post-quantum ssh-mldsa44-ed25519
signature algorithm without the "@openssh.com" suffix used by the
previous experimental implementation, which was removed.

- Add ssh-mldsa44-ed25519 (available since OpenSSH 10.6).
- Mark ssh-mldsa44-ed25519@openssh.com as available in OpenSSH
  10.4-10.5 only, with a note that it was removed in 10.6.
- Don't recommend adding algorithms to software newer than the last
  version that supports them, so OpenSSH 10.6+ no longer gets the old
  name suggested.
- Add a test covering the recommendations for OpenSSH 10.3 to 10.7.

Fixes #378

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
